#lang rmn/v2
(map
  ("type" "CellIdentityVerificationLaw")
  ("version" 2)
  ("precondition" "Receive one canonical CapabilityCellManifest version 2 that names a canonical RMN StockKeepingUnit, capability law identity, controller, and claimed face addresses, plus one independently callable observer for any claimed face the caller can presently assay.")
  ("operation" "Derive a stable RFC 6920 cell identity only from SKU, capability, and controller; separately identify the manifest revision carrying mutable face addresses; classify every standard face as bound, absent, or invalid; then require both the ActivityPub knowledge-circulation face and EVM state-and-settlement face for the single full CapCell profile.")
  ("postcondition" "Return one canonical RMN verification relation naming the stable cell identity, manifest-revision identity, SKU, capability, controller DID, profile, every face disposition and evidence, and the profile admission result. Changing a face address changes the manifest revision but never silently changes the cell or product identity.")
  ("refusal" "Refuse malformed manifests, undeclared faces, partial-cell profiles, or any observer result that does not bind the exact stable cell identity and controller. A claimed but unobservable or mismatched face is invalid, never silently absent or bound."))
